using Global

~ ending_start

Noman: Sign here. And here.

Jason: (He signs. The NDA. The severance letter. The silence.)

Noman: Pleasure doing business, Jason. Don't make me see you again.

if Global.marcus_path == "bought":
	Jason: (He thought about Marcus on the drive home. He kept thinking about him for a long time after that.)
elif Global.marcus_path == "told":
	Jason: (He wondered, signing the last page, whether Marcus had gotten a deal even half this good. He suspected the answer.)

Jason: (The money would cover a year, easy. He kept telling himself the number, like it would make the rest of it quieter.)

# --- ENDING: BOUGHT ---
# The "clean" complicit ending. Jason takes the deal, walks away safe
# and wealthy, and carries all of it with him anyway.

=> END
